WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Employees & permissions”, then open the “Work hours” tab.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Open Work hours
From Employees & teams open the Work hours tab.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Set the schedule
Choose the team, the working days and the start and end times according to the available fields.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Save and review
Save the changes and check the schedule shown, and review any replies or automations tied to out-of-hours.
